# 21x80 — the old smallest height with the pinned mark: the height tiers are gone (the owner's directive of 2026-09-23 commits the settled
# mark to the scrollback), so the mark is committed once and the palette (8 rows) opens under the rule without ever drawing it; Esc closes it
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆(?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*\d+\.\d+\.\d+
expect sess \$
sleep 0.3
send /
expect Tab
sleep 0.4
mark palette
send \x1b
sleep 0.3
send \x03
expect Say hi
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
